1
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:52,680
What are you doing?

2
00:01:53,600 --> 00:01:54,860
Reading a sci-fi novel

3
00:01:55,280 --> 00:01:56,520
about a woman

4
00:01:56,960 --> 00:01:57,920
who hates the world

5
00:01:57,920 --> 00:02:00,920
and decides to lead the Trisolarans to destroy Earth.

6
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:02,970
That's so interesting.

7
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:05,930
I really hope she succeeds.

8
00:02:08,240 --> 00:02:09,370
What happened next?

9
00:02:10,880 --> 00:02:11,680
Later?

10
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:16,040
Later,

11
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:18,240
whether it's the world hated by people

12
00:02:18,240 --> 00:02:20,240
or the world humanity tries to save,

13
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:22,480
it all turns into a blank sheet of paper.

14
00:02:22,640 --> 00:02:24,370
No one can despise her anymore.

15
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:25,480
She is free.

16
00:02:46,520 --> 00:02:47,640
Give me a smile.

17
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:51,160
That's right.

18
00:02:52,440 --> 00:02:53,640
You teach me to smile.

19
00:02:53,920 --> 00:02:55,720
You should smile more yourself.

20
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:11,090
Let's go.

21
00:03:12,680 --> 00:03:14,160
The wind is the freest,

22
00:03:14,160 --> 00:03:16,240
formless and unhindered.

23
00:03:16,760 --> 00:03:18,160
So you want to be the wind.

24
00:03:19,320 --> 00:03:21,200
But the wind can't stop either.

25
00:03:21,440 --> 00:03:22,680
Once it stops,

26
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:23,840
the wind dies.

27
00:03:24,320 --> 00:03:25,960
Then keep running forward.

28
00:03:31,880 --> 00:03:33,200
I did it.

29
00:03:33,520 --> 00:03:35,000
Lucid dreams do exist.

30
00:03:35,240 --> 00:03:37,360
Weightlessness really can wake you up from a dream.

31
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:38,760
What did you dream about?

32
00:03:42,440 --> 00:03:43,400
Some dreams

33
00:03:44,120 --> 00:03:45,800
are meant to escape reality.

34
00:03:46,480 --> 00:03:47,540
While other dreams

35
00:03:47,880 --> 00:03:49,520
are meant to give you the ability

36
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:50,720
to return to reality.

37
00:03:57,440 --> 00:03:58,600
Lucid dreaming

38
00:03:59,480 --> 00:04:01,200
is a state where a person

39
00:04:01,640 --> 00:04:03,360
realizes they are dreaming

40
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:06,760
and can even control the dream.

41
00:04:07,440 --> 00:04:08,640
That means

42
00:04:09,320 --> 00:04:10,720
in your own dream,

43
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:12,200
you won't die,

44
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:13,520
right?

45
00:04:15,240 --> 00:04:16,560
The wind can't stop.

46
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:20,880
I'm not dead yet.

47
00:04:50,640 --> 00:04:53,480
A shadow comes for revenge.

48
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:55,800
Don't give up on living.

49
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:58,080
This time,

50
00:04:58,840 --> 00:05:00,370
it's not to get everything,

51
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:03,680
but to end all the mistakes

52
00:05:04,640 --> 00:05:06,170
and missed opportunities.

53
00:05:44,280 --> 00:05:45,080
Save me.

54
00:05:52,159 --> 00:05:52,960
What's wrong?

55
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:55,730
You're not the only smart one tonight.

56
00:05:56,600 --> 00:05:57,930
There's another person

57
00:05:58,720 --> 00:06:00,650
who has also been seeking revenge.

58
00:06:08,960 --> 00:06:09,680
Xiaofei.

59
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:12,480
Just keep it.

60
00:06:14,680 --> 00:06:15,680
I think Mala

61
00:06:17,480 --> 00:06:19,540
would also want you to take care of it.

62
00:06:27,320 --> 00:06:29,520
So you and Uncle Dai were acting too.

63
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:32,860
Actually, I knew from the very beginning

64
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:34,840
that Dai is Mala's father.

65
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:37,800
Tonight I gave Zhiwei

66
00:06:38,280 --> 00:06:39,320
his final test.

67
00:06:41,120 --> 00:06:42,650
Unfortunately, he failed.

68
00:06:54,159 --> 00:06:54,960
You're awake.

69
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:02,010
What happened? How did you get hurt like this?

70
00:07:04,360 --> 00:07:05,360
It's a long story.

71
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:08,040
Are you possessed or something?

72
00:07:08,520 --> 00:07:10,120
You kept changing all night.

73
00:07:12,960 --> 00:07:13,960
Take a look.

74
00:07:14,920 --> 00:07:15,720
See that?

75
00:07:17,960 --> 00:07:18,800
You hit me.

76
00:07:23,480 --> 00:07:25,680
You didn't stab yourself, did you?

77
00:07:27,280 --> 00:07:28,840
I'm not that crazy.

78
00:07:30,080 --> 00:07:31,640
How long until we reach the bottom of the mountain?

79
00:07:31,640 --> 00:07:32,970
It's going to be a while.

80
00:07:40,880 --> 00:07:42,000
Interesting.

81
00:07:43,640 --> 00:07:45,120
Am I dreaming,

82
00:07:47,159 --> 00:07:48,520
or is this reality?

83
00:07:51,080 --> 00:07:52,760
Then wake up.

84
00:07:53,760 --> 00:07:55,820
Reality is much scarier than a dream.

85
00:07:56,840 --> 00:07:57,720
Yeah.

86
00:08:04,600 --> 00:08:05,840
Mala's necklace.

87
00:08:11,680 --> 00:08:13,240
I see it.

88
00:08:14,840 --> 00:08:16,920
Then let me tell you my story.

89
00:08:22,200 --> 00:08:23,720
Mala in your book

90
00:08:25,520 --> 00:08:26,760
is my son.

91
00:08:30,080 --> 00:08:32,409
I gave him the best life since he was a child

92
00:08:33,120 --> 00:08:34,850
and sent him to the best school.

93
00:08:35,960 --> 00:08:37,400
I didn't expect that day

94
00:08:37,760 --> 00:08:39,799
would be the last time I saw him.

95
00:08:41,240 --> 00:08:42,039
Mr. Dai.

96
00:08:42,760 --> 00:08:44,440
We've been searching for a long time,

97
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:45,500
but found nothing.

98
00:08:46,120 --> 00:08:47,120
What do you think?

99
00:08:48,400 --> 00:08:50,060
Later, I received the bad news

100
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:52,720
that my son committed suicide due to bullying.

101
00:08:54,520 --> 00:08:55,360
Impossible.

102
00:08:56,640 --> 00:09:00,160
I won't let anyone who bullied or hurt Mala get away with it.

103
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:05,080
I will make everyone involved in this pay the price.

104
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:09,080
Why are you telling me this?

105
00:09:11,360 --> 00:09:13,680
Mala's death has nothing to do with me.

106
00:09:14,160 --> 00:09:15,120
This necklace

107
00:09:15,480 --> 00:09:18,120
was a gift left to him by his mother before she died.

108
00:09:18,120 --> 00:09:19,840
He always wore it

109
00:09:20,920 --> 00:09:22,320
and never took it off.

110
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:27,880
After Mala disappeared,

111
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:30,000
this necklace also disappeared.

112
00:09:30,680 --> 00:09:32,440
Until Sophie came to me with this necklace

113
00:09:32,440 --> 00:09:34,680
and the novel 'The Death of Mala'.

114
00:09:37,600 --> 00:09:38,800
The book is very good.

115
00:09:39,160 --> 00:09:40,080
I signed it.

116
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:44,200
But I want to meet the author in person.

117
00:09:51,160 --> 00:09:52,040
Men.

118
00:09:52,040 --> 00:09:54,120
That was the moment I realized Mala's departure

119
00:09:54,120 --> 00:09:55,960
was not only related to you,

120
00:09:55,960 --> 00:09:57,760
but also written into a book by you.

121
00:09:57,760 --> 00:09:59,520
You wanted to use my son's death

122
00:09:59,840 --> 00:10:02,360
as a stepping stone to your success.

123
00:10:02,360 --> 00:10:04,840
I said I'd use our 20 years of friendship

124
00:10:04,840 --> 00:10:06,370
in exchange for this favor.

125
00:10:07,240 --> 00:10:09,440
For everything you did to Mala,

126
00:10:09,440 --> 00:10:11,770
I will make you pay the most painful price.

127
00:10:12,080 --> 00:10:14,010
I also want you to taste the feeling

128
00:10:14,120 --> 00:10:16,120
of having everything seemingly at your fingertips,

129
00:10:16,120 --> 00:10:19,360
only to instantly lose everyone and your reputation.

130
00:10:19,360 --> 00:10:20,360
I'll kill you.

131
00:10:21,760 --> 00:10:23,080
Xinghe Award.

132
00:10:23,280 --> 00:10:24,120
Celebration Banquet.

133
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:25,200
Did I really kill Mala?

134
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:26,480
Everything

135
00:10:26,760 --> 00:10:27,520
is a hell

136
00:10:27,520 --> 00:10:30,440
I carefully prepared for you.

137
00:10:47,480 --> 00:10:47,940
Mr. Dai.

138
00:10:48,280 --> 00:10:49,960
We have a backup boat here.

139
00:10:50,640 --> 00:10:51,900
We'll set off right now

140
00:10:51,960 --> 00:10:54,360
to pick you and your friends up from the island.

141
00:10:54,360 --> 00:10:55,240
No need.

142
00:10:57,160 --> 00:10:58,520
My friends

143
00:10:59,400 --> 00:11:00,720
all like staying here.

144
00:11:06,280 --> 00:11:07,680
There is no Xinghe Award.

145
00:11:08,840 --> 00:11:10,240
There is no talent scout,

146
00:11:10,760 --> 00:11:12,360
and certainly no success.

147
00:11:14,160 --> 00:11:15,320
Kid,

148
00:11:16,160 --> 00:11:18,720
do you really think you've hit the big time?

149
00:11:19,800 --> 00:11:21,280
In my eyes,

150
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:24,280
you're nothing but a bunch of

151
00:11:24,440 --> 00:11:26,500
worthless trash on a chopping block.

152
00:11:27,160 --> 00:11:28,320
Impossible.

153
00:11:28,400 --> 00:11:29,320
You

154
00:11:30,680 --> 00:11:33,210
should just die along with your trashy books,

155
00:11:35,160 --> 00:11:37,000
completely worthless.

156
00:11:43,440 --> 00:11:45,360
What are you so proud of?

157
00:11:48,080 --> 00:11:49,320
You're just

158
00:11:51,680 --> 00:11:53,940
using the thrill of destroying our lives

159
00:11:54,680 --> 00:11:57,120
to fill your own guilt.

160
00:11:59,720 --> 00:12:02,160
Do you really think you're a good father?

161
00:12:03,160 --> 00:12:05,620
You've never been a father. What do you know?

162
00:12:06,520 --> 00:12:08,080
I gave my son

163
00:12:08,840 --> 00:12:10,800
the best material conditions in life.

164
00:12:10,800 --> 00:12:11,530
Understand?

165
00:12:12,440 --> 00:12:14,200
Don't you just want to know

166
00:12:15,240 --> 00:12:16,500
what exactly happened

167
00:12:17,640 --> 00:12:18,800
to Mala

168
00:12:19,440 --> 00:12:21,680
that night?

169
00:12:32,840 --> 00:12:34,440
Let me tell you.

170
00:12:38,120 --> 00:12:40,280
The most ironic thing in this story is

171
00:12:40,960 --> 00:12:42,280
that at that time,

172
00:12:42,440 --> 00:12:44,100
the only person who saved Mala

173
00:12:44,640 --> 00:12:45,840
was me.
